# Class: :YieldDescription (Yield Description)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 :YieldDescription "Qualification node that specifies what a distribution delivers, comprising exactly one delivery mode and optional temporal quality, coverage, service quality, and verification method descriptors.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :YieldDescription "Qualifies WHAT a Distribution delivers.")
